flowchart TD
    Pkt["packet/flow key<br/><b>does:</b> supplies src, dst, mark, iif/oif, tos<br/><b>why next:</b> policy rules match these fields<br/><b>state:</b> flowi4/flowi6 lookup key"]
    Rules["fib_rules walk<br/><b>does:</b> checks rules in ascending priority<br/><b>why next:</b> first matching rule selects an action/table<br/><b>state:</b> current rule cursor"]
    Custom{"custom rule matches?<br/><b>example:</b> from 10.99.0.0/24 lookup 100"}
    CustomTable["table 100 lookup<br/><b>does:</b> longest-prefix match in selected table<br/><b>why next:</b> route result found or lookup fails<br/><b>state:</b> fib_result or no route"]
    Local["priority 0: local table<br/><b>does:</b> catches local/broadcast routes<br/><b>why next:</b> unmatched traffic falls through<br/><b>state:</b> may produce local delivery result"]
    Main["priority 32766: main table<br/><b>does:</b> normal route lookup<br/><b>why next:</b> most packets resolve here<br/><b>state:</b> nexthop, route type, metrics"]
    Default["priority 32767: default table<br/><b>does:</b> last policy fallback if populated<br/><b>state:</b> final chance before ENETUNREACH"]
    Result["fib_result<br/><b>does:</b> carries route type, nexthop, scope, prefsrc<br/><b>why next:</b> route code builds dst/rtable<br/><b>state:</b> selected table's answer"]

    Pkt --> Rules --> Custom
    Custom -->|yes| CustomTable
    Custom -->|no| Local
    Local -->|no route| Main -->|no route| Default
    CustomTable -->|found| Result
    Local -->|found| Result
    Main -->|found| Result
    Default -->|found| Result

    classDef key fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb
    classDef rule fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706
    classDef out fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a
    class Pkt key
    class Rules,Custom,Local,Main,Default rule
    class CustomTable,Result out
